  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Jupiter.Runtime::Jupiter.World.Readable
  title: Galley rota, Month 4
  body: 'MON      Ferreira

    TUE      Okafor

    WED      Lindqvist

    THU      Mori

    FRI      Ashford

    SAT/SUN  whoever lost at cards


    MUGS: everyone. Every time. I mean it.   (H.M.)


    Handwritten underneath:

    Bossa nova is NOT "elevator music with a tan."   (L.F.)


    Underneath that, in a different pen:

    It is a little bit.   (M.L.)'
  setsFlag: 
