  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Jupiter.Runtime::Jupiter.World.Readable
  title: Crayon drawing, taped inside Sam's locker
  body: 'A drawing of Jupiter in orange and brown crayon. Someone has given it a big smiling face, with the red spot for a nose.


    Across the bottom, in careful capital letters:


    FOR UNCLE SAM.

    BRING IT BACK AND TELL ME IF IT HAS A FACE.


    LOVE ZARA (8)'
  setsFlag: 
